        "cooked": "<p>Seems obvious to me.&nbsp; Because he's Guise, and he's a Completionist.&nbsp; Of course he has to have all three versions!&nbsp; And of course it has to be a 4th-wall-breaking gag!</p><p>Reminds me of a limited-print vinyl some bands collaborated on called \"Make the Collector Nerd Sweat.\"</p>",
