        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nilus/{size}/2099_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-07T00:36:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I lol’d when I realized all three were different. &nbsp;I think it’s just a silly little nod to the character.&nbsp;</p><p>Honestly I’m more unhappy that the variant cards that come with Obilvaeon have better quality art then the foil ones shipped last year for the most part. &nbsp; Why would anyone want to play with foil Xtreme Prime Wardens when the variant art ones are so much cooler.&nbsp;</p>",
