        "id": 220925,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-07T01:52:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I actually think the alternates look better, for the most part.&nbsp; The lines are cleaner, the level of detail higher.&nbsp; I was actually thinking of asking Adam a letters page question about what it was like to simultaneously work on his best work and make cards for the new heroes in a slightly older, more primitive style to be consistent with the other heroes.</p><p>The XPW are an exception.&nbsp; Those are deliberately done in a retro style that works brilliantly, if less aethetically pleasingly.</p>",
